{"unit_id":"makima-coder__DeepSeekBubbleChat#card-zh","repo":"makima-coder/DeepSeekBubbleChat","commit":"8a89f0157cf0f5b30aa1555b921933896dbd6cf3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BubbleChat 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的分支对话插件。它在对话界面加入选区工具条、锚点标签和独立气泡面板；选中一段文字即可围绕原文提问，问题发回当前会话以沿用上下文，回答显示在气泡中并可定位回原文。它还支持管理多个分支和保存面板状态，适合阅读长对话时针对局部内容继续追问。无需额外 API 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:895-930","lib/client.js:1339-1357"]}
{"unit_id":"makima-coder__DeepSeekBubbleChat#card-en","repo":"makima-coder/DeepSeekBubbleChat","commit":"8a89f0157cf0f5b30aa1555b921933896dbd6cf3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BubbleChat is a DSH web plugin for asking about selected chat text in a separate bubble. Questions return to the current session with its context; answers stay in the bubble, and anchors locate the original passage. It supports multiple branches and saves panel state locally. No API setup is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:895-930","lib/client.js:1339-1357"]}
